# The web UI is embedded in the firmware image byte for byte: its files are LF on every
# machine, whatever core.autocrlf says (CRLF copies made the image larger and failed
# tests/device/ui_smoke.py on 2026-11-12, after a git stash on Windows).
firmware/components/p64_web/ui/** text eol=lf
firmware/components/p64_web/ui/**/*.png binary
